and is still living  right here in new york  and now captain rickenbacker  you've been asking me a lot of questions  how about you  you have the conventional medal of honor  and a lot of other decorations what's  your story  well corporal our time is almost up so i  won't be able to answer that question  tonight but i do want to thank you for  this page you have given us out of the  most dramatic period in our country's  development  it is very much worthwhile for americans  of this generation to pause and consider  the hardships of the soldiers the  pioneer and the indian scouts like  yourself who within a single lifetime  have doubled the size of our country  through winning of the west
 

